  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ancestors were long in the practice of weaving many things including webs, lies, and even the fabric of magic. You have inherited a small measure of their talents.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Character level 3rd, werespider-kin.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the akashic subtype<sup>AM</sup>. While in your bestial form you are always considered to have the Lashing Spinnerets veil shaped and you do not count it against your total veils shaped or veil slots. As this veil does not count against your veil slots or chakras, you can still shape a different veil into the same slot as Lashing Spinnerets freely.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/skinwalker-heritages#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
